Customers 1 to 6 arrive one per minute and join a queue q. Whenever an even-numbered customer has just joined, the front customer is served. What are q and the list of served customers after customer 6 joins (and the service at that minute)?

q, served = [], []
for t in range(1, 7):
    q.append(t)
    if t % 2 == 0:
        served.append(q.pop(0))
